WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:01.600
Why won't you say hello?

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:03.200
[panting]

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:11.760
Hello Malfoy.

00:00:19.783 --> 00:00:21.169
What are you two doing? 

00:00:21.915 --> 00:00:23.107
Professor Snape.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:27.900
Come with me Malfoy.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.467
Malfoy. Are you fond of Potter?&nbsp;

00:00:35.571 --> 00:00:38.000
That idiot? Absolutely not.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.374 --> 00:00:42.174
Befriending Potter is a betrayal of the Dark&nbsp;Lord.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.440
Remember that. 

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:45.696
Yes. I'll be careful.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:49.200
You may go.

00:00:56.560 --> 00:01:02.040
A Slytherin and a Gryffindor. Love&nbsp;
is never easy. Is it James?

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:05.463
Are you all right?

00:01:05.463 --> 00:01:06.545
Leave it Potter.

00:01:07.819 --> 00:01:09.318
There's&nbsp;something I wanted to ask.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.010
What?&nbsp;

00:01:11.413 --> 00:01:13.072
Would you go to the ball with me?

00:01:13.868 --> 00:01:15.067
Really?

00:01:15.162 --> 00:01:16.576
Yes.&nbsp;I want to go with you.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:17.076
Of course i..

00:01:20.829 --> 00:01:23.111
Of course not. Don't be ridiculous Potter.

00:01:23.111 --> 00:01:23.907
Wait.

00:01:25.386 --> 00:01:26.661
I`m serious.

00:01:26.661 --> 00:01:28.729
then prove it.

00:01:28.933 --> 00:01:30.647
Don`t get the wrong idea.

00:01:30.647 --> 00:01:31.800
You hang around with mud&nbsp;bloods.

00:01:32.457 --> 00:01:34.529
Well, I guess I was wrong. 

